To generate a well-formed paragraph from the given input text, you can use a combination of string concatenation and conditional statements to add appropriate punctuation and spacing between words. Here's an example modification to your code:
```
String inputText = "Environmentally clear, energy efficient";
String[] words = inputText.split("\\s+");
