How can we use C++ to find the earliest time of day that a group of high-performing athletes can finish their fitness challenge at the same time? Each athlete has chosen a different physical activity and committed to doing it for a certain number of hours each day for a week. Here are their chosen activities and the number of hours they commit to:
- Runner: 4 hours of running per day
- Swimmer: 3 hours of swimming per day
- Cyclist: 5 hours of cycling per day
- Weightlifter: 2 hours of weightlifting per day
- Gymnast: 6 hours of gymnastics per day
Assuming each athlete starts their activity at the same time each day and takes no breaks, we can calculate the earliest time they can finish their activities at the same time using the following C++ code:
```c++
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;
int main() {
    int runner_hours = 4;
    int swimmer_hours = 3;
    int cyclist_hours = 5;
    int weightlifter_hours = 2;
    int gymnast_hours = 6;

    int max_hours = max(max(max(runner_hours, swimmer_hours), max(cyclist_hours, weightlifter_hours)), gymnast_hours);

    for(int i = 0; i < 24; i++) {
        int num_hours = 0;
        for(int j = 0; j < 7; j++) {
            if(i >= 6 && i + runner_hours <= 24) {
                num_hours++;
            }
            if(i >= 8 && i + swimmer_hours <= 24) {
                num_hours++;
            }
            if(i >= 7 && i + cyclist_hours <= 24) {
                num_hours++;
            }
            if(i >= 9 && i + weightlifter_hours <= 24) {
                num_hours++;
            }
            if(i >= 4 && i + gymnast_hours <= 24) {
                num_hours++;
            }
        }
        if(num_hours == 5) {
            cout << "All athletes can finish their activities at the same time at " << i << ":00." << endl;
            break;
        }
    }
    return 0;
}
```
This code calculates the maximum number of hours any athlete will be doing their activity in a day and then loops through all possible starting times (from 0 to 23) to check if all athletes can finish their activities at the same time. If a starting time is found where all athletes finish at the same time, the code outputs that time.

