```
The normalized text is the original text with variations in word forms replaced with their base forms. In this example, the normalized text would be "I am feel happy today :)", which is easier to analyze and classify accurately.
By using these techniques and experimenting with different models and datasets, we can improve the accuracy of our classification and handle nuances and variations in language.

